00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:57,900
So this close family member could redeem the land,

242
00:16:57,900 --> 00:17:03,300
but as you can imagine, in an agrarian culture that was discouraged from accumulating generational wealth,

243
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:07,960
the cost to redeem your relative's land would likely come at a sacrifice to your own estate

244
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:11,240
