00:19:40,460 --> 00:19:41,400
It is difficult.

283
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,080
It is risky.

284
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:46,340
But at the same time, it's relatively easy in comparison to the Leveret marriage.

285
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:52,560
And so it's interesting, if Boaz really wanted to marry Ruth, if this was his goal, if this was his desire,

