00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:56,880
then why at the beginning of these legal proceedings, for my lawyers in the room,

287
00:19:56,880 --> 00:20:01,360
why would he start with like the easiest thing and say, here, just redeem the land?

288
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,940
This is your right.

289
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:09,360
This is your, it's a puzzling, puzzling way to go about the proceedings.

