00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,080
This is, this is a no brainer for me.

292
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:16,400
I will redeem Naomi.

293
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,160
I will redeem her land.

294
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:24,080
The close relative doesn't even hesitate to agree to perform the actions of Goel, of guardian redeemer for Naomi.

295
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:31,940
Yes, it was an act of sacrificial love, but it was the best case scenario for a guardian redeemer.

296
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:39,520
Because in his mind, Naomi is past childbearing age, relatively old, probably not going to live for that long.

297
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,040
And she has no heir.

298
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:43,880
So what that means is he's going to get the land.

299
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:49,220
And then when the year of Jubilee comes, there's nobody to give that land back to.

300
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:50,740
So it's his now.

301
00:20:50,740 --> 00:20:51,860
He gets to keep the land.

302
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:57,780
And so although it is an act of sacrificial love, this situation in particular, in his mind, is a no brainer.

