00:20:57,780 --> 00:21:04,200
He's going to just keep Naomi alive for a couple of years, and he is going to inherit her land forever.

304
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:07,080
I don't know how long.

305
00:21:07,080 --> 00:21:08,420
I don't know how old she is.

306
00:21:08,420 --> 00:21:08,900
Leave me alone.

