00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:21,240
Modern medicine is a wonderful thing.

312
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:22,840
Okay, all right, I got to get out of here.

313
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:24,480
Let's move on.

314
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:34,480
This is where, in verse 5, we see Boaz likely catching everyone off guard.

315
00:21:34,480 --> 00:21:38,920
Let's read it in verse 5 after this guardian redeemer, who we don't know his name yet.

