00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,380
We'll come back to that.

317
00:21:40,380 --> 00:21:41,980
He says, of course I'll redeem it.

318
00:21:41,980 --> 00:21:42,480
No problem.

319
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:57,900
Then Boaz said, on the day you buy the land from Naomi, you will also acquire Ruth the Moabite, the foreigner, the person who comes from a land that worships a God that is totally in opposition to the God of our people.

