00:22:05,100 --> 00:22:08,020
So now he's inviting this person to become a leveret husband.

322
00:22:08,020 --> 00:22:25,840
Not only do you have to redeem the land, but you have to marry Ruth, and you have to produce a son for her so that that son can take the lineage of Elimelech, and then that name will be restored to the genealogy so that Naomi's family has land and inheritance for the future and eternal redemption.

