00:24:35,340 --> 00:24:41,840
He said, look, Naomi, she's an older widow, past childbearing ages, with no heir.

348
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:46,020
This man is essentially saying, yeah, I'll take care of her for a couple of years so that I can have her land.

