00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,440
She laid down her old life.

427
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:47,300
She said no to her past.

428
00:30:47,300 --> 00:30:52,420
She said no to everything that was calling her back, the invitation to just go back to your old life.

429
00:30:52,420 --> 00:30:52,980
She repented.

430
00:30:52,980 --> 00:30:55,920
She said no to all of it in order to pursue Yahweh.

