440
00:31:37,860 --> 00:31:46,200
Lay down your life to receive a whole other new life that's far better than anything you could have come up with on your own.

441
00:31:46,200 --> 00:31:53,520
Be invited to participate in God's kingdom work, taking care of the widow, the orphan, those in need.

