463
00:33:08,040 --> 00:33:11,380
First, they look back to the matriarchs of the nation of Rachel and Leah.

464
00:33:11,380 --> 00:33:17,460
Showing the incredible radical inclusion for Ruth as a foreigner.

465
00:33:17,460 --> 00:33:22,880
Reminding Boaz that his bold faith and sacrificial love will not soon go forgotten.

466
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:26,540
Ruth is included in the names of the Israelite matriarchs.

467
00:33:26,540 --> 00:33:31,700
They're saying God is a God who radically welcomes those who want to pursue him by faith.

468
00:33:32,760 --> 00:33:42,580
And just like the nation of Israel is never going to forget the names of Leah and Rachel, the elders are saying, may our nation, may our people, may we never forget the name of Ruth.

