00:33:42,580 --> 00:33:53,500
Who showed radical sacrificial love to leave her homeland and to come and to take care of Naomi and to participate with Boaz in this incredible act of sacrificial love.

470
00:33:56,840 --> 00:34:00,760
It's a reminder that God has a track record of fulfilling his promises to his people.

471
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:07,760
Abraham left everything based on a promise of God to build a nation.

472
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:14,440
And Rachel and Leah are a testimony that God continues to be faithful to his promises.

473
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:17,980
That God will continue to bring about redemption even when we can't see it.

474
00:34:17,980 --> 00:34:19,760
Even when it looks like all hope is lost.

475
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:25,100
That God continues to remain faithful to his promises if his people will continue to pursue him in faith.

476
00:34:25,100 --> 00:34:29,080
And even when we don't, he gets through that and continues to bring about redemption.

477
00:34:29,080 --> 00:34:30,720
That's what Judah and Tamar are all about.

478
00:34:30,720 --> 00:34:34,680
God has a track record of fulfilling his promises to his people.

479
00:34:34,680 --> 00:34:43,800
I've been jamming to a worship song lately called Time and Time Again.

