00:34:43,800 --> 00:34:49,140
And the lyrics that I love, I think, remind us of this truth.

481
00:34:49,140 --> 00:34:51,500
He says, you'll come through now like you did back then.

482
00:34:51,500 --> 00:34:54,180
Time and time and time again.

