00:36:48,280 --> 00:36:58,460
The seed of the woman that was promised in Genesis 3, we get clarity that that seed, the more we progress through the nation of Israel, the more clarity we get about the Messiah and where he will come from.

508
00:36:58,460 --> 00:37:01,260
We know that it will come through the line of Judah.

509
00:37:01,260 --> 00:37:07,480
Every time a new baby was born to this family line, there was a possibility of Israel's promised Messiah coming.

