00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:20,360
Praise be to Yahweh, who on this day has not left you without a guardian redeemer.

575
00:42:22,040 --> 00:42:29,700
We've talked a lot in this series about human participation, and the author intentionally leaves God's activity relatively absent from the book.

