00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:34,300
But in the end, Yahweh is the ultimate redeemer.

577
00:42:34,300 --> 00:42:39,020
We're invited to participate, but he is the author and perfecter of our salvation.

578
00:42:41,720 --> 00:42:44,020
This is the story of divine and human partnership.

