652
00:49:16,560 --> 00:49:33,460
And as we sing about how reckless that love is, how sacrificial that love is, may we also think about people in our lives whom God might be inviting us to lay down our own life for the sake of them.

653
00:49:34,740 --> 00:49:44,520
To take the love that we've received from God and to extend it to others so that his kingdom might come and his will might be done on earth as it is in heaven.

654
00:49:51,420 --> 00:50:16,100
Before I spoke a word, you were singing over me.

655
00:50:16,100 --> 00:50:46,080
Before I spoke a word, you were singing over me.

656
00:50:46,080 --> 00:51:16,060
To take the love, you were singing over me.

